            {
                "entry_id": "664f063e-96e4-3538-83ac-028b0036f0bd",
                "word": "saurian",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "cc451bdc-fc73-4d7a-8840-2a169b18baf2",
                        "entry_id": "664f063e-96e4-3538-83ac-028b0036f0bd",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "saurians"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "39e4ee6d-7118-3f83-a0b8-dd1100d8f8a6",
                        "entry_id": "664f063e-96e4-3538-83ac-028b0036f0bd",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A reptile of the suborder Sauria."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "767dee75-6d0a-402c-a6b1-0be5ca3db035",
                                "sense_id": "39e4ee6d-7118-3f83-a0b8-dd1100d8f8a6",
                                "text": "I took heart, however, as I recalled a conversation between Challenger and Summerlee upon the habits of the great saurians."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a46f3b35-f92e-3724-a03b-cb6c73b8919e",
                        "entry_id": "664f063e-96e4-3538-83ac-028b0036f0bd",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Any large reptilian animal, including crocodiles and reptilian aliens."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "especially"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "5421c107-ffa1-4789-a38a-a4151ed0f463",
                                "sense_id": "a46f3b35-f92e-3724-a03b-cb6c73b8919e",
                                "text": "After dinner we all went on deck and watched the unfamiliar scenes of a Capronian night--that is, all but von Schoenvorts. There was less to see than to hear. From the great inland lake behind us came the hissing and the screaming of countless saurians. Above us we heard the flap of giant wings, while from the shore rose the multitudinous voices of a tropical jungle--of a warm, damp atmosphere such as must have enveloped the entire earth during the Palezoic and Mesozoic eras."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9f71be08-5dcd-440e-9515-85c670ceba4c",
                                "sense_id": "a46f3b35-f92e-3724-a03b-cb6c73b8919e",
                                "text": "Good evening, fellow saurians, and welcome once again to the Tri-Sports Arena! I'm your host, Raz Charkov..."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "403b7124-b954-30ec-9955-4d724cee2690",
                        "entry_id": "664f063e-96e4-3538-83ac-028b0036f0bd",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A lizardlike person."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "figuratively"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e03320d8-03f9-4b83-add6-fc19da79111e",
                                "sense_id": "403b7124-b954-30ec-9955-4d724cee2690",
                                "text": "He was one of the very few larger saurians in the émigré marshes."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "2d4d3510-522d-4e18-a40e-54b8d5cf2ed6",
                        "source_entry_id": "664f063e-96e4-3538-83ac-028b0036f0bd",
                        "source_sense_description": "reptile of the suborder Sauria",
                        "target_lang_word": "sauriër",
                        "target_lang_code": "nl",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "sauriër",
                                "target_lang_code": "nl",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8948ea4b-b68b-3479-9909-a3f9b1319961",
                                        "entry_id": "1bc608e4-c2f4-3267-8a2e-350d7f69b473",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "een zeer ruime groep van (voorhistorische) dieren waaronder vogels en bijna alle reptielen"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f9487982-814d-44b1-a5f1-4194865dec5c",
                                                "sense_id": "8948ea4b-b68b-3479-9909-a3f9b1319961",
                                                "text": "Wetenschappers hebben in China een sauriër met vier vleugels uitgegraven. Het fossiel is een belangrijke link in de evolutie van dinosauriërs naar vogels. Dat deelde Xing Xu van de universiteit van Shenyang in het vakblad Nature mee."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4e40ee31-5b02-44e4-b156-288207ee7760",
                                                "sense_id": "8948ea4b-b68b-3479-9909-a3f9b1319961",
                                                "text": "In Winterswijk is een schedel gevonden van een nog niet eerder gevonden sauriër. Amateur-paleontoloog Remco Bleeker ontdekte het fossiel in een steengroeve. Het blijkt te gaan om een Lariosaurus."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "e633d33e-59d0-402d-9498-fd242ca8c2ad",
                        "source_entry_id": "664f063e-96e4-3538-83ac-028b0036f0bd",
                        "source_sense_description": "reptile of the suborder Sauria",
                        "target_lang_word": "saurien",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "saurien",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6ec029d4-ae6e-3439-8552-1183d78b6471",
                                        "entry_id": "3e657181-dbcc-3122-8324-b207e03c2fed",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Relatif aux oiseaux et aux reptiles."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8ad74707-5c4d-45ed-8e78-8a77d7eb9ebc",
                                                "sense_id": "6ec029d4-ae6e-3439-8552-1183d78b6471",
                                                "text": "Une créature saurienne hante le Loch Ness, dit-on."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4e40d9db-46a3-4645-80ff-f00845ab1bee",
                                                "sense_id": "6ec029d4-ae6e-3439-8552-1183d78b6471",
                                                "text": "Une démarche saussurienne dans un tringlant cérémonial, un sac de dame en peau saurienne, avec le fion de l’animal."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "saurien",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "dc07622e-1d6c-3d37-8fb3-150792b1fd52",
                                        "entry_id": "f4c4112f-8a07-39a6-bdb6-4d0eaf76492e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Taxon non classé qui regroupe les oiseaux et les reptiles vivants."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "445f4741-3acb-469e-a555-8849921705fb",
                                                "sense_id": "dc07622e-1d6c-3d37-8fb3-150792b1fd52",
                                                "text": "La toiture de la Casa Batlló, très découpée et revêtue de tuiles émaillées, évoque irrésistiblement la silhouette d'un saurien."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "17ce641d-6235-43f8-8d44-4a2773fe8f00",
                                                "sense_id": "dc07622e-1d6c-3d37-8fb3-150792b1fd52",
                                                "text": "Plus grand parc animalier européen dédié à la découverte des reptiles, la Ferme aux crocodiles de Pierrelatte (Drôme) abrite plus de 1000 animaux en semi-liberté, dont 350 sauriens."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d2c6c018-d284-4036-b596-b909f5bf2855",
                                                "sense_id": "dc07622e-1d6c-3d37-8fb3-150792b1fd52",
                                                "text": "Si l’on peut appeler cela une « idée », alors il y a eu déjà une phase d’idéocratie réalisée dans l’histoire de la Terre : l’idéocratie des grands sauriens du secondaire."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "8a26eb7a-88f3-4475-963a-b6e3594bba6e",
                        "source_entry_id": "664f063e-96e4-3538-83ac-028b0036f0bd",
                        "source_sense_description": "reptile of the suborder Sauria",
                        "target_lang_word": "Saurier",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
